<!--
  The script of the training "DLC: PC controls" (quest c0f0). The port builds it into the game's binary XML at start
  (runtime/dlc.c); runtime/quest.c describes the conditions and actions of a quest script.

  A quest is tasks (TaskList) that run side by side; a task is lines (LineList) and a line is commands (CommandList)
  run in order: a condition (typeIF and its parameters) with an action (typeEXEC and its parameters). Action 1 holds
  its line while its condition is true, action 2 goes to the next line (EXECLine -1: the task ends).

  start   the "training started" notice (groups 0 and 4 of the base quest's EnemySet), as the game's trainings
  intro   controls off for one second; the tutorial window af00 (action 18; a window of this DLC, dlc.xml); waits
          for it to close (condition 33); controls on; quest flag 0
  press   waits for flag 0, then for ZL and ZR held together, whatever input they are bound to (condition 0x20300:
          a condition the port answers, 0x20000 + the buttons' bits, true while one of them is not held); flag 1
  end     waits for flag 1: the window closed, the "training finished" notice (group 2), action 46 ends the quest
-->
